# Raspberry Pi additions, composed after omarchy-base.packages and
# omarchy-aarch64.packages (omarchy-pkg-defaults aarch64-pi). The kernel and
# boot chain come with the machine's Arch Linux ARM image, whose firmware
# partition this port never writes: these packages keep them current from the
# repositories alone. linux-rpi is the 4k-page kernel; linux-rpi-16k trades
# compatibility (Electron builds, Wine, box64 targets) for throughput and is
# left to the owner. rpi5-eeprom ships the EEPROM update tooling only; nothing
# here runs it against the machine.
linux-rpi
raspberrypi-bootloader
raspberrypi-overlays
raspberrypi-utils
firmware-raspberrypi
rpi5-eeprom
